<h1>About</h1>

<p>Wheelhouse is run by Marta Ríos, who opened the shop to do bike repairs the honest way: a clear price list on the wall, a real diagnosis in writing, and no work started without the customer's go-ahead.</p>

<h2>The team</h2>
<p>Our mechanics handle the repairs, from a quick tune-up to a full overhaul, and photograph every bike on arrival so its condition is never in doubt. The counter staff register arriving bikes, keep owners up to date, and let you know the moment your bike is ready.</p>
